      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITE touches: View Service (pre-aggregates, so one hot\nvideo is NOT 3k Kafka messages/s), Kafka, views consumer,\nview counts; the consumer flags trending videos and\npre-warms CDN POPs. Upload is the same as row A.\n\nREAD touches: in-process cache -> Redis -> Cosmos for\nmetadata; segments: CDN edge -> origin shield -> Blob.\nThe count shown is approximate (lags ~1 min).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WRITE touches: View Service (pre-aggregates, so one hot\nvideo is NOT 3k Kafka messages/s), Kafka, views consumer,\nview counts; the consumer flags trending videos and\npre-warms CDN POPs. Upload is the same as row A.\n\nREAD touches: in-process cache -> Redis -> Cosmos for\nmetadata; segments: CDN edge -> origin shield -> Blob.\nThe count shown is approximate (lags ~1 min).",
